  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär Juda ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k runi ruëc Ɣo-ce-ya gat Elaa kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, Cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa gat A-ɣadh kuäär Juda ruec tok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë tookɛ ruec tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bäŋuan. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Äbi nya Dhɛ-kar-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni cuŋ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial ce̱tnikɛ tëë ca la̱t ɛ gua̱n ni Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ gua̱th pali kuth guäyni woc kä cuɛ riäkni töl kɛnɛ kuoth Ac-tar-te. Kä cuɛ thɔ̱l ëë ci Muthɛ jɛ la̱t kɛ yiëëth in yian tiac, kɛ ɣöö cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ŋot wa̱ŋkɛ jɛ wal ɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱. Kä cɔal kɛ jɛ i̱ Nɛ-uc-tan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ŋäth ni Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cuɛ thil kuäär mi cu ce̱tkɛ jɛ kä kua̱r Juda tëë nhiam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cɛ käp ni Kuoth Nhial. Kä /kenɛ guurɛ päl, cuɛ tit ni luëëk tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ la̱r Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial tekɛ jɛ kɛɛl, gua̱thni diaal tin cɛ wä thi̱n, cuɛ buɔ̱m, kä cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ kuäär A-thi-ri-ya, kä /kenɛ jɛ lätikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt näk nikä Gadha cu mäni wi̱i̱kɛ, a känɛ jɛ ni raar wec cu mäni rɛy ti̱ecni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ŋuaan runi kua̱r ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa min ku la bärɔw runi ruëc Ɣo-ce-ya gat Elaa kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, cu kuäär A-thi-ri-ya ni Cɛ̈l-mɛ̈n-ɛ-thɛr Tha-mɛ-ria ben go̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ thuɔ̱k runi da̱ŋ diɔ̱k cuɛ ka̱n, kɛ bäkɛl runi kua̱r ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa min la bäŋuan runi Ɣo-ce-ya kuäär thuk duëli kuec caam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär A-thi-ri-ya ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl naŋ kä A-thi-ri-ya ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th kä Ɣɛlɛ̈, kɛnɛ Ɣa-bor, kiir Go-dhan, kɛ wi̱i̱ ji̱ Ma-day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö /ka̱n Kuoth Nhial Kuothdiɛn luɔ̱th cukɛ lo̱k ni gukdɛ, amäni tëë ca lat ɛ ja̱ŋdɛ ni Muthɛ. /Ken kɛn kɛ liŋ kä /ka̱n kɛ luɔ̱th.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dhia̱t ji̱ Thi-ri-ya kɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ wäl ŋuaan runi kua̱r ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa, cu kuäär A-thi-ri-ya ni Thɛ-nɛ̈-kɛ̈-rib wi̱i̱ Juda diaal tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m ben ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa kuäär A-thi-ri-ya jäk kä raan kä La-kic i̱ “Pälä, ɣän cä duer la̱t. Kä mɔ bi thiec kä ɣä mɔ bä la̱t.” Kä cu kuäär A-thi-ri-ya da̱a̱p mi ki̱luni ti bathdɔɔr, kɛnɛ ki̱luni cikä mi bo̱r ti bathdɔɔri wäl thiec kä Ɣidh-ki-yaa kuäär Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa ɛ ka̱m ciɛk in bo̱r min te tɔ̱ɔ̱wä luaak Kuɔth Nhial kɛɛliw, kɛnɛ dhɔr kua̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa da̱a̱p in cɛ rɔth ni thiekni luaak Kuɔth Nhial kɛnɛ thiekni duëël kua̱r ka̱n, kä cuɛ kɛ jäk kä kuäär A-thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär A-thi-ri-ya Tar-tan, kɛnɛ Rɛ̈b-tha-rith, kɛ Rɛ̈b-ca-kee kɛɛl kɛ rɛm mi di̱i̱t kä La-kic jäk kä kuäär ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä cukɛ ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä min cikɛ cop, cukɛ ben cuɔ̱ŋ wi̱i̱ puɔ̱l in di̱i̱t dup kakä raam min guic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cikɛ kuäär cɔl, cu Ɛl-ya-kim gat Ɣil-ki-yaa gui̱i̱c cieŋ kɛnɛ Cɛb-naa min la bolith, kɛ bulkamiin ni Yo-ac gat A-thap ben kä kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ̈b-ca-kee kɛ jiök i̱, “La̱rɛ jɛ Ɣidh-ki-yaa i̱, ‘Ci kuäär in di̱i̱t kuäär A-thi-ri-ya nɛmɛ lar. Ɛŋu mi ŋääthi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caari jɛ kɛn rieet ti̱ti̱ dëë kɛ ko̱r tɛr? Ɛŋa ŋääthi ɔ, mɔ curi gaak kɛ ɣä mɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ ji̱n ŋääthi ni ji̱ I-jëp, min ce̱tkɛ kɛɛt wääthä, min la ri̱el tet raam mi ci rɔ nhiɛt kɛ jɛ. Ɛ jɛn ce̱tkɛ min la kuäär I-jëp ni Pɛro jɛ a lät kä nɛy tin ci rɔ nɔ̱a̱k jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mi wi̱i̱ ɣä jiök i̱, “Ca̱kɔ rɔ nɔ̱a̱k Kuoth Nhial Kuothda,” /ciɛ jɛn ɛn nëë ci Ɣidh-ki-yaa gua̱th pali kɛ, kɛnɛ yi̱k nikɛ däk, mëë jio̱kɛ Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm i̱, “Bia pal nhiam yi̱kä mɛmɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bër latdɛ ruac yɛnɛ kuäärä ni kuäär A-thi-ri-ya. Ɣän bä ji̱ ka̱m jio̱ŋko̱o̱ri ti bathdɔɔri rɛw, mi bi nɛy ti bi kɔt jɔkdiɛn luäŋ kɛ jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä deri raan kɔar kua̱rä kulɛ loc i̱di kä ji̱ kɔar kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya tin tiɛni, a bi wä ŋäth ni I-jëp kɛ kui̱ thurbiɛɛli kɛnɛ jio̱ŋko̱o̱ri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min dɔ̱ŋ /ciɛ ɣän ɛ nëë mäk ɛn gua̱a̱th ɛmɛ kä däk jɛ kä thilɛ riet kä Kuoth Nhial? Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱ wër däkɛ ɛn wec ɛ mɔ.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
